    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῳδι-ᾰκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδιον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>for</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδια, ζῳδιακός</span> (with or without
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span>), ὁ, <i>the Zodiac</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eudem.
			</span></i> ap. Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.198H.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.100
			</span></i> K., <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.31
			</span></i>, etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ζῳδιακή</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.168
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					198
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				22.12
			</span></i>, <u>PMich.</u>in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Class.Phil.</u>
				22.13
			</span></i>.</div>
